#: ../../../install_osx.md:1
msgid "Binary Installation on MacOS Mojave (10.14)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:3
msgid ""
"All the Citadel binaries are available in Mojave using the [homebrew package "
"manager](https://brew.sh/). The homebrew tool can be installed using:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:6
msgid ""
"/bin/bash -c \"$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/"
"install/master/install.sh)\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:10
msgid ""
"After installing the homebrew package manager, Ignition Citadel can be "
"installed running:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:12
msgid ""
"brew tap osrf/simulation\n"
"brew trust osrf/simulation\n"
"brew install ignition-citadel\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:18
msgid ""
"All libraries should be ready to use and the `ign gazebo` app ready to be "
"executed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:20
msgid ""
"Head back to the [Getting started](getstarted) page to start using Ignition!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:23
msgid "Uninstalling binary install"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:25
msgid ""
"If you need to uninstall Ignition or switch to a source-based install once "
"you have already installed the library from binaries, run the following "
"command:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:28
msgid "brew uninstall ignition-citadel\n"
msgstr ""

